ration`, `parser`, `predicate`, `validator` | S11 external wake, retry, marker, and sidecar fixture. |\n| `src-tauri/tests/wu_b_mailbox_integration.rs` | `accessor`, `filter`, `formatter`, `mapper`, `orchestration`, `parser`, `predicate`, `validator` | Built-in mailbox notification and delivery fixture. |\n\n## Focused production inventory\n\nOnly S11-added or meaningfully changed production responsibilities are listed; auditors still own whole touched-file inspection.\n\n| File | Function or symbol | A1 class | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `crates/oulipoly-provider/src/process.rs` | spawn observer/process identity helpers | `orchestration`, `accessor` | Observe launched provider process identity for sidecar ownership. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-provider/src/client.rs` | client invoke with spawn observer | `orchestration` | Route provider subprocess launch through observer-aware process execution. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/cli/spawn_identity.rs` | external launch spawn identity functions | `orchestration`, `mapper`, `validator` | Persist provider process/session identity in sidecar metadata. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/external_provider/context.rs` | settings id derivation | `mapper` | Use selected provider settings id for external provider policy/launch. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/external_provider/dispatch.rs` | external dispatch/backfill flow | `orchestration` | Invoke policy/launch, capture process identity, and backfill captured session id. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/external_provider/request_builder.rs` | policy/launch request builders | `mapper`, `filter` | Build hybrid policy launch shape and bounded environment. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-state/src/db.rs` | exact user-turn body lookup | `predicate`, `accessor` | Confirm delivery from existing ingested turn body evidence. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-state/src/mailbox.rs` | delivery failure/attempt helpers | `orchestration`, `mapper`, `validator` | Track pending/delivered/failed mailbox attempts in the sidecar. |\n| `src-tauri/src/mailbox_delivery.rs` | delivery prompt and confirmation helpers | `orchestration`, `formatter`, `validator` | Build notification prompt, emit nonce markers, and mark success/failure. |\n| `src-tauri/src/run/resume/orchestration.rs` | resume delivery confirmation flow | `orchestration`, `predicate`, `validator` | Confirm or reject mailbox delivery after resume using provider turn evidence. |\n| `src-tauri/src/wake_coordinator.rs` | headless wake retry flow | `orchestration`, `predicate` | Spawn/retry detached wakes and release claims on failure. |\n\n## Adapter declarations\n\n```yaml\nadapter_declarations:\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-provider/src/client.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - provider client invocation contract\n      - provider subprocess process-observer contract\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-provider/src/error.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - external provider error protocol envelopes\n      - Oulipoly provider client error surface\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-provider/src/generated.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - external provider JSON protocol envelopes\n      - Oulipoly typed provider client DTOs\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-provider/src/process.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - provider subprocess lifecycle contract\n      - Oulipoly process identity observer contract\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/external_provider/request_builder.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - Oulipoly model/provider dispatch context\n      - external provider policy.evaluate and launch request JSON contracts\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/external_provider/launch_result_mapper.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - external provider LaunchExit event stream/session metadata\n      - Oulipoly runtime execution result and session capture fields\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/external_provider/dispatch.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - Oulipoly executor dispatch contract\n      - external provider policy/launch client contract\n      - sidecar process identity capture contract\n  - component: src-tauri/src/mailbox_delivery.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - sidecar mailbox notification rows\n      - provider resume prompt and submitted-turn marker contract\n      - mailbox delivery confirmation status\n  - component: src-tauri/src/run/resume/orchestration.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - resolved resume targets\n      - external provider start-known-session launch requests\n      - mailbox delivery confirmation and retry outcomes\n      - legacy CLI resume requests when no provider ref is present\n  - component: src-tauri/src/wake_coordinator.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - agent-messenger notification requests\n      - PTY delivery control socket contract\n      - headless detached wake command contract\n      - sidecar mailbox wake claims\n  - component: src-tauri/tests/s11_external_provider_wake.rs\n    role: adapter\n    Translates:\n      - external provider script fixture contract\n      - CLI launch/notify/wake/resume integration surface\n      - sidecar mailbox and invocation result assertions\n```\n\n## Intrinsic-surface declarations\n\n```yaml\nintrinsic_surface_declarations:\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-state/src/mailbox.rs\n    role: intrinsic-surface\n    Domain: sidecar_mailbox_delivery_state\n    Owns:\n      - mailbox pending/delivered/failed rows\n      - delivery_attempts and delivery_error updates\n      - wake claims and sidecar session runtime metadata\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-runtime/src/executor/cli/spawn_identity.rs\n    role: intrinsic-surface\n    Domain: external_provider_process_identity\n    Owns:\n      - provider child PID identity observation\n      - sidecar owner/session backfill\n      - launch-time sidecar identity validation\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-state/src/db.rs\n    role: intrinsic-surface\n    Domain: existing_session_turn_lookup\n    Owns:\n      - session_turns body lookup\n      - exact user text match predicate\n```\n\n## Test-harness declarations\n\n```yaml\ntest_harness_declarations:\n  - component: src-tauri/tests/s11_external_provider_wake.rs\n    role: test-harness\n    Surface:\n      - isolated XDG config/data/cache fixture directories\n      - external provider Python script fixture\n      - CLI launch, notify, wake, and resume commands\n      - sidecar pid-identity and mailbox row assertions\n      - submitted-turn marker positive and negative assertions\n  - component: src-tauri/tests/wu_b_mailbox_integration.rs\n    role: test-harness\n    Surface:\n      - mailbox notification and resume integration fixture\n      - exact ingested turn confirmation assertions\n      - mailbox batch and ordering assertions\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/age217_s6a_policy_launch_dispatch.rs\n    role: test-harness\n    Surface:\n      - external provider policy/launch fake provider\n      - request and environment capture assertions\n```\n\nNo `state.db` schema migration is declared or required by this gate. The sidecar mailbox database owns the new delivery-attempt metadata used by S11.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":212,"totalLines":212,"truncated":false}},"title":"../../home/nes/projects/agent-runner/worktrees/age-pid-sidecar/planning/s11-gate/contracts/s11.contract.md","time":{"start":1780782348040,"end":1780782348085}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_02a7eae52b1f1412016a24950bf4f88193b3f03e8b12babf06"}},"id":"prt_e9ee63703001XrVZj5dEXhjB7l","sessionID":"ses_1611a223effeVm9QJZLOjnSHiy","messageID":"msg_e9ee5ded00018U4MXfBBrZzlIy"}}
